{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0f5c3191-4f83-8e9a-b9aa-7be219ad6ec5",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T11:37:58-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucille Pellegrino",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:35:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:35:16-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. Yes, my name is Lucille Pellegrino. I'm calling about the low spot at the end of my block. It's under water again, and I mean a lot of water. I measured it this morning against a yardstick and it's about a foot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:35:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A foot, okay. And this is from the storm over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:35:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, last weekend's snow-to-rain storm, Sunday into Monday. It started as snow Sunday, turned to rain, and the snowbanks melted right into that dip. It's Wednesday now. Two days later and it has not gone down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:35:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll happen when the drain's blocked up. Hang on, let me jot this down. Low spot, end of the block, about a foot of standing water. [pause] Can you give me the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:36:01-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd rather not give my address on this call, I'm just reporting the spot. It's the dip at the very end of the block, where the road slopes down. I can describe it however you need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:36:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's fine. I'll note it as the low point at the end of the block, and we can sort out the exact location when we call you back. Is it covering the whole road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:36:26-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both lanes, nearly. Cars are creeping through the edge by the curb. I'll tell you, it was not this bad last winter. I keep a notebook, I've tracked snowfall totals in it for years, every storm, date and inches. Last winter we had plenty of snow and that spot drained fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:36:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A notebook, huh, that's thorough. So you'd know. Okay, so it's worse than last year, and it's not draining at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:36:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Now, what I want to know is whether a work order will be opened for this, and for what date. I don't want a vague answer. I'd like it written down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:37:03-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can open a work order right now for a crew to check the drain and the water. As for the date, the crews are working through a pile of calls from the storm, so I'd say it'll be a few days, maybe into early next week. I'll put it in as a flooding issue so it gets looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:37:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days, into early next week. Let me write that. [pause] All right. And will someone tell me when it's done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:37:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can have the supervisor call you. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:37:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:37:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0185. And it's under Pellegrino, P-E-L-L-E-G-R-I-N-O?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:37:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Two L's in Lucille, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:37:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. You're all set, Ms. Pellegrino. The work order's in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:37:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Kevin. I'll be watching that spot, and my yardstick, in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:37:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Take care now."
    }
  ],
